只在前分支（update_gated_fusion）的基础上修改了 run_meacap_invlm.sh文件，让它支持通过 MEMORY_ID、WEIGHT_PATH 等环境变量切换 Flickr 域内/跨域配置。

改动说明
新增可配置环境变量（与 eval_*_meacap.sh 风格一致）：

变量	默认值	含义
MEMORY_ID
coco
记忆库
MEMORY_CAPTION_NUM
5
检索 caption 数量
EXP_NAME
train_coco
权重目录名
EPOCH
14
checkpoint epoch
WEIGHT_PATH
由 EXP_NAME+EPOCH 拼出
直接指定权重路径（优先级更高）
DEVICE
0
GPU 编号
USE_ILR
0
是否开启 ILR
FUSION_TYPE
gated
linear / gated
FUSION_W1 / FUSION_W2
0.8 / 0.2
linear 融合权重
可直接复制的命令
COCO 域内
# 无 ILR
bash scripts/run_meacap_invlm.sh images/instance1.jpg
# linear
USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=linear bash scripts/run_meacap_invlm.sh images/instance1.jpg
# gated
USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated bash scripts/run_meacap_invlm.sh images/instance1.jpg
Flickr30k 域内
USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=linear MEMORY_ID=flickr30k \
  EXP_NAME=train_flickr30k EPOCH=29 \
  bash scripts/run_meacap_invlm.sh ./annotations/flickr30k/flickr30k-images/1007129816.jpg
USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=gated MEMORY_ID=flickr30k \
  WEIGHT_PATH=checkpoints/train_flickr30k_gated/coco_prefix-0029.pt \
  bash scripts/run_meacap_invlm.sh ./annotations/flickr30k/flickr30k-images/1007129816.jpg
COCO → Flickr30k 跨域
USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=linear MEMORY_ID=flickr30k \
  EXP_NAME=train_coco EPOCH=14 \
  bash scripts/run_meacap_invlm.sh ./annotations/flickr30k/flickr30k-images/1007129816.jpg
Flickr30k → COCO 跨域
USE_ILR=1 FUSION_TYPE=linear MEMORY_ID=coco \
  EXP_NAME=train_flickr30k EPOCH=29 \
  bash scripts/run_meacap_invlm.sh ./annotations/coco/val2014/COCO_val2014_000000000042.jpg
使用要点
不设 WEIGHT_PATH：用 EXP_NAME + EPOCH 自动拼路径，例如 checkpoints/train_flickr30k/coco_prefix-0029.pt
设 WEIGHT_PATH：直接指定完整路径（适合 train_*_gated 等备份目录）
默认行为不变：不传任何环境变量时，仍是 COCO 域内 + train_coco/0014 + 无 ILR
